Official distribution
---------------------

TUTTIFRUTTI AS (Norwegian organisation number 919 650 826), as copyright
holder, is the official distributor of Arcen. It:

  - distributes official signed and notarized builds of Arcen Deck and Arcen
    Pier, including through app stores and platform marketplaces;
  - offers pre-installed images and packages for cloud and remote
    workstations;
  - provides paid support.

The source code for every official build is available in the public
repository, https://github.com/Aanerud/arcen_public, at the matching release
tag (for example, the build of version 0.19.0 is built from tag v0.19.0).
Each official build carries a build ID that names that release and source
revision; see docs/operations/versioning-and-releases.md.

